{"ticker":"ARES","updated":"2026-10-30T22:34:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Ares Management Corporation","shortName":"Ares Management Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ares.com","fullTimeEmployees":3967,"marketCap":42517086208,"trailingPE":59.055294,"forwardPE":18.207935,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.536423,"pegRatio":0.95,"targetMeanPrice":144.55,"targetHighPrice":168.0,"targetLowPrice":119.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.187,"earningsGrowth":-0.77,"grossMargins":1.0,"operatingMargins":0.028900001,"profitMargins":0.086899996,"totalRevenue":4980667904,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":181.19,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":95.8,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.24},"summary":"Ares Management Corporation operates as an alternative asset manager. Its Direct Lending Group segment provides financing solutions to small-to-medium sized companies. The company's Private Equity Group segment specializes in early venture, turnaround, mid venture, late venture, recapitalization, growth capital, middle market, mezzanine, distressed and growth buyouts. The firm seeks to invest in healthcare, services, energy, industrials and consumer. The firm seeks to takes majority, minority and shared-control investments primarily in under-capitalized companies in North America, Europe, Asia Pacific, Southeast Asia and Australia. Its Real Estate Group segment invests in new developments and the repositioning of assets, with a focus on control or majority-control investments; and originates and invests in a range of self-originated financing opportunities for middle-market owners and operators of commercial real estate. The firm prefers to invest between $1 million and $500 million in companies having EBITDA between $10 million and $250 million and debt investment value between $10 million and $100 million. Ares Management Corporation was founded in 1997 and is based in Los Angeles, California with additional offices in North America, Europe and Asia.","summary_zh":"Ares Management Corporation 是一家另類資產管理公司。其直接貸款集團部門為中小型企業提供融資解決方案。該公司的私募股權集團部門專注於早期風險投資、扭虧為盈、中期風險投資、後期風險投資、資本重組、成長資本、中間市場、夾層、不良資產和成長性收購。該公司尋求投資醫療保健、服務、能源、工業和消費品領域。該公司尋求主要對北美、歐洲、亞太地區、東南亞和澳洲資本不足的公司進行多數股權、少數股權和共享控制投資。其房地產集團部門投資於新開發項目和資產重新定位，重點是控製或多數控制投資；為商業房地產的中間市場所有者和運營商創造並投資一系列自源融資機會。該公司傾向於向 EBITDA 在 1,000 萬至 2.5 億美元之間、債務投資價值在 1,000 萬至 1 億美元之間的公司投資 100 萬至 5 億美元。 Ares Management Corporation 成立於 1997 年，總部位於加州洛杉磯，在北美、歐洲和亞洲設有辦事處。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資產管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":175.94,"h":179.9,"l":173.43,"c":179.78,"v":1430700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":178.67,"h":179.83,"l":174.97,"c":176.82,"v":1244000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":177.7,"h":180.185,"l":176.475,"c":180.05,"v":1171300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":181.36,"h":181.86,"l":174.53,"c":177.31,"v":1638800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":177.0,"h":177.645,"l":173.36,"c":176.25,"v":1731200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":175.37,"h":176.65,"l":174.87,"c":175.07,"v":979900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":175.58,"h":179.88,"l":175.02,"c":178.93,"v":1202700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":179.1,"h":185.14,"l":178.645,"c":184.71,"v":1412400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":185.2,"h":185.82,"l":182.79,"c":182.79,"v":837100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":184.17,"h":184.28,"l":178.95,"c":179.92,"v":1311900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":179.2,"h":179.99,"l":176.7,"c":178.61,"v":1120300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":178.46,"h":182.115,"l":177.64,"c":178.89,"v":1175500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":180.42,"h":185.94,"l":180.42,"c":183.42,"v":1365900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":183.4,"h":183.85,"l":180.81,"c":183.0,"v":2112000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":181.54,"h":182.42,"l":179.517,"c":181.99,"v":1053800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":182.15,"h":186.85,"l":180.37,"c":181.15,"v":1056400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":181.31,"h":181.31,"l":167.753,"c":168.23,"v":1889200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":164.76,"h":166.81,"l":162.85,"c":163.32,"v":2265500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":164.82,"h":166.17,"l":162.